        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="8BfTQBOIwbfhKneN2qXS-8" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="Test: shouldCreatePaymentAndPublishEvent&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;Expected:&#xa;SUCCESS&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;Actual:&#xa;PENDING&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;Failure frequency:&#xa;- Passed in build #101&#xa;- Failed in build #102&#xa;- Passed in build #103&#xa;- Failed in build #104&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;Thread dump:&#xa;Kafka listener was still processing payment event when assertion executed.&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;Log:&#xa;2026-05-22 10:15:31 Payment created with status PENDING&#xa;2026-05-22 10:15:32 Kafka event published&#xa;2026-05-22 10:15:34 Payment status updated to SUCCESS" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="400" width="430" x="860" y="3940" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="8BfTQBOIwbfhKneN2qXS-9" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;h1 data-section-id=&quot;rqe5hk&quot; data-start=&quot;11605&quot; data-end=&quot;11654&quot;&gt;Demo 3: AI-Based Log &amp;amp; Metric Anomaly Detection&lt;/h1&gt;&#xa;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;151jjl6&quot; data-start=&quot;11656&quot; data-end=&quot;11668&quot;&gt;Objective&lt;/h2&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;11670&quot; data-end=&quot;11746&quot;&gt;Show how AI can analyze logs and metrics to detect abnormal behavior faster.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;11748&quot; data-end=&quot;11751&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;e3orm3&quot; data-start=&quot;11753&quot; data-end=&quot;11764&quot;&gt;Scenario&lt;/h2&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;11766&quot; data-end=&quot;11836&quot;&gt;During peak traffic, payment latency increases and some requests fail.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;11838&quot; data-end=&quot;11841&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;ppwv10&quot; data-start=&quot;11843&quot; data-end=&quot;11857&quot;&gt;Sample Logs&lt;/h2&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;11859&quot; data-end=&quot;12587&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;2026-05-22T10:00:01 INFO Payment request received txnId=TXN-1001 amount=500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;2026-05-22T10:00:01 INFO Idempotency key validated txnId=TXN-1001&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;2026-05-22T10:00:02 INFO Ledger entry created txnId=TXN-1001 latencyMs=210&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;2026-05-22T10:05:01 WARN Payment request slow txnId=TXN-2091 latencyMs=2800&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;2026-05-22T10:05:04 WARN DB connection wait time high waitMs=1800&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;2026-05-22T10:05:06 ERROR Payment failed txnId=TXN-2092 error=SQLTransientConnectionException&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;2026-05-22T10:06:01 WARN Payment request slow txnId=TXN-2101 latencyMs=3400&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;2026-05-22T10:06:03 ERROR HikariPool-1 - Connection is not available, request timed out after 30000ms&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;2026-05-22T10:06:05 ERROR Payment failed txnId=TXN-2102 error=DB_CONNECTION_TIMEOUT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;12589&quot; data-end=&quot;12592&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;16rkr1w&quot; data-start=&quot;12594&quot; data-end=&quot;12611&quot;&gt;Sample Metrics&lt;/h2&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;12613&quot; data-end=&quot;12896&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;payment_request_count=1200/min&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;payment_success_rate=91%&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;payment_error_rate=9%&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;payment_p95_latency_ms=4200&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;payment_p99_latency_ms=7800&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;db_connection_active=50&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;db_connection_max=50&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;db_connection_pending_threads=38&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;kafka_publish_latency_ms=120&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;cpu_usage=62%&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;memory_usage=71%&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="960" width="560" x="970" y="4510" as="geometry" />
