        <mxCell id="gJ9fQJMAkEa3Ao8VECqi-3" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=22;" value="Kubernetes Cluster&#xa;│&#xa;├── Application Pod&#xa;│   └── /actuator/prometheus or /metrics&#xa;│&#xa;├── Service&#xa;│   └── Exposes application metrics port&#xa;│&#xa;├── ServiceMonitor / PodMonitor&#xa;│   └── Tells Prometheus what to scrape&#xa;│&#xa;├── Prometheus&#xa;│   └── Pulls metrics periodically&#xa;│&#xa;└── Grafana&#xa;    └── Reads data from Prometheus and shows dashboard" vertex="1">
